WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
HSBC-EM: Heads up, MXN liquidity is thinning out ahead of the local holiday tomorrow.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ling: Thanks for flagging, do you have a sense of how much size the market can still absorb today?

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
HSBC-EM: Meaningfully less than usual, we would not quote real size after sixteen hundred today.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Ling: Understood, we will try to get anything we need done well before that cutoff.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
HSBC-EM: Good call, spreads have already started widening a touch in the local market.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Ling: Any read on when liquidity comes back after the holiday?

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
HSBC-EM: Should be back to normal the day after, local desks tend to reopen fairly quickly.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Ling: Good to know, we will plan around that if anything comes up over the break.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
HSBC-EM: Sounds good, happy to help if you need an indicative level before the cutoff.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Ling: Appreciate it, will reach out if anything develops before sixteen hundred.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
HSBC-EM: Sounds good, talk soon.
